["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/FunctionalSafety/EvidenceType/log", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "Time-stamped records capturing system or operational data recorded as usually as a response to specific triggers in a specified environment.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
